with your partners, or don't. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field necessities</strong> - smoke a cigarette, drink some whiskey, use whatever tools the job calls for. The government doesn't ask how you cope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment and consumables</strong> - a range of items to give you the edge on your missions. Some tactical, some less so.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 player co-op</strong> - bring a team or go alone. The work still needs to get done.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic noir with a few loose screws</strong> - crooked officials, dark alleys, and missions that get weirder the deeper you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A 1–4 player co-op espionage experience where you and your friends do dirty jobs for the government.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4696800/8b8cc70ac44b6bd97297cb8ab628f4a7a807be3d/header.jpg?t=1784452916", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4696800/f246b1524b9287ca7ee40efdcead1c9acd746589/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784452916", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4696800/f246b1524b9287ca7ee40efdcead1c9acd746589/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784452916", "website": "https://standardproceduregame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  64-bit Windows 11 (Latest Feature Update)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-4430<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 2GB / AMD<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</st