orror, and crime.\r\nThe game also includes use of alcohol, tobacco, and illegal drugs (including drug trafficking), mild profanity, and adult humor covering topics such as death, crime, mental health, and substance abuse. It contains simulated gambling environments and chance-based mechanics, though no real money is involved.\r\nStandard Procedure supports online interactivity and in-game text and/or voice chat, which are not moderated by the developers."}, "ratings": {"dejus": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "16", "required_age": "16", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Drogas ilícitas\nViolência\nTemas sensíveis"}, "steam_germany": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "16", "required_age": "16", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Drogen\nSelbstmord\nSchimpfwörte"}, "igrs": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "18", "required_age": "18", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Simulasi dan/atau kegiatan judi\nInteraksi Daring\nRokok dan/atau rokok elektronik, minuman beralkohol, narkotika, psikotropika, dan/atau zat adiktif lainnya"}}}}}